{"articleNo":"203182","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=203182&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로]2019-1학기 2차 국가근로장학사업 학생신청 안내[1.29.(화)~3.6.(수) 18시]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.01.23","hit":"5667","attachments":[{"name":"붙임1. 2019년도 1학기 2차 국가근로장학금 학생신처어 매뉴얼(홈페이지, 모바일)_2019012210173900.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=203182&attachNo=5807"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2019학년도 1학기 국가근로장학사업 2차 학생신청 일정을 다음과 같이 알려드리니,</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">참여를 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">​</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 신청일정 : 2019.1.29.(화) 09:00 ~ 3.6.(수) 18:00시까지 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2. 신청대상 : 2019-1학기 국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청장소 : 한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\"><u>www.kosaf.go.kr</u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">)에서 신청</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 신청방법 : 첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 유의사항</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은&nbsp;학교 홈페이지 공고 참고</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2차 학생신청기간에 국가근로장학사업을 신청하지 않을 경우</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 방학 집중근로에 참여 불가</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">​</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp; 2019학년도 1학기 국가근로통합신청 학생매뉴얼 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
